<p>NOTE: (a) Adoption of New Quarterly Accounting Calendar: Since inception, Xicor's quarterly accounting periods have consisted of three 12-week quarters and one 16-week fourth quarter. Beginning in 1996, Xicor's quarterly accounting periods were changed to four even 13-week quarters.  Xicor's fiscal year, which ends on the Sunday nearest December 31, did not change. In 1996, Xicor's quarters ended on March 31, June 30, September 29 and December 29. For purposes of financial statement presentation, each fiscal year is deemed to have ended on December 31.  Fiscal years 1996 and 1995 each consisted of 52 weeks.</p>
